# Local env files hold API keys; they never go into the build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Local node_modules would trigger the csproj Tailwind step, and the sdk image has no node.
# CI's fresh checkout has none, so excluding it makes local builds match CI.
**/node_modules

# Six Labors licence keys are private; the Docker build gets one as a build secret.
**/sixlabors.lic
